      "message": "docs(process): name the documentation site as step 5 of the release cut\n\nAGENTS.md's cut steps now say the tag run's site and pages jobs\nregenerate and deploy the Zola site (and the browser build at /app/),\nand that the cut is done once pages is green and the live site shows\nthe new version. A red pages job is re-run, never fixed by moving the\ntag. PROCESS_VERSION 53 -> 54.\n\nThis was the last open \"Done means\" item of #688: the site, its version\nand download links, the Pages deploy and the browser build (#1103) had\nall shipped.\n\nFixes #688\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
